# ── Secrets: never commit ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# I10. If one of these ever lands in a commit, ROTATE THE KEY — removing the line
# later does not remove the blob from history.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.pem
*.key
*.keystore
*.jks

# ── Python — api/ and ingest/ ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
*.egg-info/

# ── Node / React Native — app/ ───────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# ── Android build output — app/android/ ──────────────────────────────────────
# React Native CLI generates these.  They are large, machine-specific, and
# regenerated by every `run-android`.
app/android/.gradle/
app/android/build/
app/android/app/build/
app/android/local.properties
*.hprof

# ── iOS build output — app/ios/ ──────────────────────────────────────────────
app/ios/Pods/
app/ios/build/
app/ios/*.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/

# ── Test + coverage artefacts ────────────────────────────────────────────────
coverage/
test-results/
htmlcov/
.coverage

# ── Editor / OS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json

# ── Agent scratch ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/.claude

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  DELIBERATELY NOT IGNORED — read before you add a rule below this line
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
#  api/app/ml/models/*.pkl        Nikhil's 42 trained quantile models (N7).
#                                 Yes, binaries in git. Here it is correct: the
#                                 t3.small must never have to train, and a model
#                                 that exists only on one laptop is a single point
#                                 of failure with a name. Keep n_estimators modest
#                                 so they stay small.
#
#  ingest/data/*.csv              Kartik's extracted Agmarknet rows (K1).
#                                 I7 — the demo makes ZERO live external network
#                                 calls. The deploy box seeds from these committed
#                                 CSVs. If they are gitignored, the box cannot seed
#                                 without hitting agmarknet.gov.in from the venue,
#                                 which is the failure mode I7 exists to prevent.
#                                 Keep the extract trimmed (two commodities, six
#                                 markets, ~2 years) — that is a few hundred KB.
#
#  app/assets/audio/**            Shreya's pre-generated Marathi mp3 clips (SH2).
#                                 Same reason: beat 7 is "airplane mode on, tap 🔊
#                                 again, it still speaks." That only works if the
#                                 clips are in the bundle.
#
#  Do not add a blanket *.pkl, *.csv or *.mp3 rule. It will silently break the
#  offline demo and you will find out at H34.
